
  gaokun3 LiveCD  (Debian 13, changes are kept in RAM only)

  This is not an installed system: the root is a read-only squashfs with a
  tmpfs overlay, and changes are lost on reboot. The boot medium is mounted
  at /media/gk3 (an in-memory copy when started from the internal disk).

  The graphical installer runs on tty1 (Ctrl+Alt+F1); its backend is gk3l.
  Partition and file system tools: sgdisk fdisk blkid mkfs.ext4 e2fsck resize2fs
  Boot evidence:        /media/gk3/gaokun3/diag/  (written by gk3-diag 45 s after boot)

